  "summary_en": "Iceland's first government AI action plan (2025-2027) with 20 actions under five pillars: AI for all, competitive business, education, public services and future healthcare. It plans a bill implementing the EU AI Act, language technology support for Icelandic, data policy, public-sector guidelines and impact analyses. It has no robotics content.",
